 "hast": "\n<p>We added <code>shadcn preset</code> commands for working with preset codes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"decode-a-preset\">Decode a preset</h2>\n<p>You can decode a preset code to see exactly what it contains:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset decode b5owWMfJ8l\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset decode b5owWMfJ8l\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest preset decode b5owWMfJ8l\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest preset decode b5owWMfJ8l\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest preset decode b5owWMfJ8l\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> decode</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b5owWMfJ8l</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"Preset\n  code         b5owWMfJ8l\n  version      b\n  style        mira\n  baseColor    mauve\n  theme        mauve\n  chartColor   amber\n  iconLibrary  hugeicons\n  font         inter\n  fontHeading  oxanium\n  radius       large\n  menuAccent   subtle\n  menuColor    inverted-translucent\n  url          https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5owWMfJ8l\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Preset</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  code         b5owWMfJ8l</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  version      b</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  style        mira</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  baseColor    mauve</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  theme        mauve</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  chartColor   amber</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  iconLibrary  hugeicons</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  font         inter</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  fontHeading  oxanium</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  radius       large</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  menuAccent   subtle</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  menuColor    inverted-translucent</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  url          https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5owWMfJ8l</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"resolve-from-a-project\">Resolve from a project</h2>\n<p>Use <code>preset resolve</code> in an existing project to see the preset that matches your current configuration.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset resolve\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset resolve\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest preset resolve\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest preset resolve\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest preset resolve\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> resolve</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"Preset\n  code         b5Kc6P0Vc\n  version      b\n  style        luma\n  baseColor    olive\n  theme        lime\n  chartColor   sky\n  iconLibrary  hugeicons\n  font         geist\n  fontHeading  inherit\n  radius       default\n  menuAccent   subtle\n  menuColor    default\n  url          https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5Kc6P0Vc\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Preset</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  code         b5Kc6P0Vc</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  version      b</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  style        luma</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  baseColor    olive</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  theme        lime</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  chartColor   sky</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  iconLibrary  hugeicons</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  font         geist</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  fontHeading  inherit</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  radius       default</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  menuAccent   subtle</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  menuColor    default</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>  url          https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5Kc6P0Vc</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>It works with monorepos too:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset resolve -c apps/web\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset resolve -c apps/web\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest preset resolve -c apps/web\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest preset resolve -c apps/web\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest preset resolve -c apps/web\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> resolve</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> -c</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apps/web</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"share-or-open\">Share or open</h2>\n<p>Use <code>preset url</code> when you need a shareable link:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset url b5owWMfJ8l\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset url b5owWMfJ8l\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest preset url b5owWMfJ8l\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest preset url b5owWMfJ8l\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest preset url b5owWMfJ8l\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> url</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b5owWMfJ8l</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5owWMfJ8l\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5owWMfJ8l</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Use <code>preset open</code> to open the preset on shadcn/create for customization:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset open b5owWMfJ8l\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest preset open b5owWMfJ8l\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest preset open b5owWMfJ8l\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest preset open b5owWMfJ8l\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest preset open b5owWMfJ8l\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> open</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b5owWMfJ8l</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"Opening https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5owWMfJ8l in your browser.\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Opening https://ui.shadcn.com/create?preset=b5owWMfJ8l in your browser.</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>This makes presets easier to inspect, share, and hand off to coding agents without manually decoding codes or building URLs.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Button\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;asChild&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;size&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sm&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Link\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/create&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 no-underline!&#x22;}]\"><p>Try a Preset</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>"
}
